    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Charity Shop</i> is an atmospheric, surreal, first-person puzzle game where you use your camera to capture the essence of a life lived. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To this end, you have been delivered to The Charity Shop, the place where people donate unwanted belongings\u2014each carrying an imprint of the time they once shared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/extras/1b62e8a96dbcfc45261efbf0f78898a4.avif?t=1755270225\" width=560 height=560 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clutch at permanence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick your feet against the rising tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your head is under, it will be over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/extras/20e9aafd76604d59a9d1849f8c1d6d53.avif?t=1755270225\" width=560 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Everything here is in a state of flux\u2014the negative space between owners. From one owner to the next, we're here to help pass the baton.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;People always have things to donate\u2014whether the owners have outlived their belongings, or their belongings have outlived them, we're always getting different things.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your digital camera to take photographs capturing the essence of a life lived, through objects once owned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and interpret your own meaning behind these objects by solving their puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserve these memories forever. Someone needs to remember...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Charity Shop has around 60 to 90 minutes of gameplay.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Charity Shop</i> is an atmospheric, surreal, first-person puzzle game where you use your camera to capture the essence of a life lived. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To this end, you have been delivered to The Charity Shop, the place where people donate unwanted belongings\u2014each carrying an imprint of the time they once shared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/extras/1b62e8a96dbcfc45261efbf0f78898a4.avif?t=1755270225\" width=560 height=560 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clutch at permanence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick your feet against the rising tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your head is under, it will be over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/extras/20e9aafd76604d59a9d1849f8c1d6d53.avif?t=1755270225\" width=560 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Everything here is in a state of flux\u2014the negative space between owners. From one owner to the next, we're here to help pass the baton.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;People always have things to donate\u2014whether the owners have outlived their belongings, or their belongings have outlived them, we're always getting different things.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your digital camera to take photographs capturing the essence of a life lived, through objects once owned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and interpret your own meaning behind these objects by solving their puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserve these memories forever. Someone needs to remember...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Charity Shop has around 60 to 90 minutes of gameplay.</i></p>",
